tools.description:
Update an existing Docker Compose stack configuration.

PATCH-STYLE UPDATE: Only specify fields you want to change.

COMMON UPDATE SCENARIOS:
- Update compose file: { file_contents: "version: '3'\nservices:..." }
- Change env vars: { environment: "DB_HOST=localhost\nDB_PORT=5432" }
- Enable auto-pull: { auto_pull: true }
- Switch git branch: { branch: "develop" }

Update an existing Komodo deployment configuration.

PATCH-STYLE UPDATE: Only specify fields you want to change.

COMMON UPDATE SCENARIOS:
- Change image: { image: { type: "Image", params: { image: "nginx:1.25" } } }
- Update env vars: { environment: "NODE_ENV=production\nPORT=3000" }
- Change ports: { ports: "8080:80\n443:443" }
- Change restart policy: { restart: "always" }
